; DNS for AI Discovery (DNS-AID) — publish at the DNS host (Cloudflare / registrar).
; Scanner looks up SVCB/HTTPS under _agents.<apex> (and possibly www).
; Sign the zone with DNSSEC.
;
; Names (relative to biointegralsaude.com.br):
;   _index._agents
;   _a2a._agents
;
; Cloudflare: DNS → Add record → type SVCB (or HTTPS).
; Name: _index._agents
; Priority: 1
; Target: www.biointegralsaude.com.br
; Value: alpn="h2,h3,http/1.1" port=443
;
; Repeat for _a2a._agents with alpn="a2a,h2,h3" port=443
; Repeat both names under www if the scanned host is www.biointegralsaude.com.br:
;   _index._agents.www
;   _a2a._agents.www

_index._agents.biointegralsaude.com.br. 3600 IN SVCB 1 www.biointegralsaude.com.br. alpn="h2,h3,http/1.1" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port
_a2a._agents.biointegralsaude.com.br. 3600 IN SVCB 1 www.biointegralsaude.com.br. alpn="a2a,h2,h3" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port
_index._agents.www.biointegralsaude.com.br. 3600 IN SVCB 1 www.biointegralsaude.com.br. alpn="h2,h3,http/1.1" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port
_a2a._agents.www.biointegralsaude.com.br. 3600 IN SVCB 1 www.biointegralsaude.com.br. alpn="a2a,h2,h3" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port
